    "detailed_description": "FEATURE<br />\r\n\u26054 character to select<br />\r\n\u260510 difficulties to select<br />\r\n\u2605Beautiful sticker style picture<br />\r\n\u2605Interesting scene<br />\r\n\u2605rich and sounds good BGM<br />\r\n<br />\r\nPOSTSCRIPT<br />\r\nThis game is adapted from my comic.<br />\r\nThere is story mode, so don't worry about not looked the original comic.<br />\r\nI wanted to make a networking game,<br />\r\nhowever, the network technology is too hard so I deleted the network mode, <br />\r\ninstead, used  local multiplay mode. <br />\r\nPlayers can use STEAM's Remote Play Together or PARSEC or other third share screen platforms for online connection.<br />\r\nIt would be great if you play it with your friends.",
